  - on-chain behavior
  - reproducibility
  - Polygon
abstract: >-
  Reproduction package for the paper "A Third-Party Reproducible Framework for On-Chain
  Behavior-Based Competency Certification". Contains the evaluation pipeline core, the rule sets
  used in the experiments, the Experiment 1-4 scripts, frozen real transaction-hash datasets,
  result CSVs, and read-only on-chain verification evidence for the deployment facts quoted in the paper.
